#14000
"Stronghold Foyer"
"You pass through the barrier and into what looks to be a foyer for the
stronghold.  The room itself is fairly spacious, and sunlight streaming
through the large bay windows provides plenty of natural light for the room. 
You notice that the view here is almost as spectacular as the one from the
balcony of the Eagle Eye Cafe.  Clearly visible through the windows is the Sea
of Stars, its waters crashing against the rocks off in the distance.  All in
all, the location and atmosphere of the room engender a sense of paradise. 
One cannot help but want to sit in this room and take a reprieve from the
troubles of life.  In the center of the room, with a fountain nearby, stands a
statue of Meriada, the Grey Lady, with her arm uplifted as if looking toward
the future dawn and the coming of the red horizon.  To the south is a marble
gate.  A lever has been set beside it.
"
""
