#14001
"Kitchen"
"Even before you entered this room, the delicious smells wafting from it
identify it as the kitchen.  Cabinets and cupboards line the walls, while pots
and pans are hung from every nook and cranny available.  Over in the corner,
you see an iron stove and griddle, ingeniously rigged so that the smoke goes
right out through a vent in the side of the cliff.  You also see a table and
some chairs sitting in one corner, made available for the passing adventurer
who only has time for a quick meal.  The chef, a robust man with a thick,
black moustache, is standing near a black kettle with a ladle in one hand. 
You might want to wander over and see what's in the kettle, since, judging by
the aroma coming from it, whatever is being cooked is bound to be delicious.
"
""
