#14002
"Meeting Hall"
"In this room you see a large oak table with maps and parchments scattered upon
it.  The table is obviously the center of the room and is surrounded by high-
backed chairs.  The walls are covered with tapestries depicting the red
horizon and the blue setting of the moon.  At the foot of the large table is a
small box from where a speaker may project his voice and inspire the listeners
in this meeting hall.
"
"[Olah] storage room is 14003
"
