#14003
"Storage Room"
"The size of this room is deceiving, as the darkness hides its true size. 
There are a few torches burning and providing ample light for what business
goes on here.  The floor is smooth and carved from the stone in the cliff. 
The walls are a smooth sand color.  A button can be seen protruding from one
of the walls.
"
"[Olah] out to meeting hall is 14002
[Olah] Storage Room.  Do NOT purge!!
"
