#14005
"A Well Cleaned Stable"
"As you enter this room you sense the smell and sound of creatures.  First
thing you see is a mass of straw and resting places for animals.  Wooden
booths are occupied with horses and other type of pets in this stable and they
all are aware of your presence.  Buckets filled with water and troughs filled
with oats and other grains fill this nicely kept stable as well.
"
