#14006
"A Bar"
"Entering this room you notice a dartboard hanging on the massive stone walls
and it seems to be in the design of a sun.  In the corner of the room you also
see a huge keg mounted on the ground with a spout.  A long bar resides against
the wall with stools placed for people to sit.  Obviously many laughs and
gossip goes around in this busy room, the presence of this room feels like a
very entertaining one at that.
"
""
