"Trophy Room"
"Everything you see in this room is full of trophies, from animal heads hanging
on the wall to a human head.  In the corner of the room stands a monstrous
alligator with it's mouth wide open as if it's jaws are were going to rip you
apart.  Magnificent weapons made from the finest metals are mounted on these
walls with beautiful designs engraved on the blades and handles.
"
""
