#14008
"Mural Room"
"Walking into this room, you can tell the strong stone walls are scattered with
slash marks and other markings.  The black marble floor with red spots seems
very intriguing, you can't seem to figure it out if it is part of the marble,
spots of blood, or maybe both.  On the south wall there is a huge mural of a
ferocious battle raging between every race and beast with a huge sun going
down over the horizon.
"
""
