#14009
"Training Room"
"Weapons hang and surround these walls everywhere.  In the corner stands a
wooden dummy with heavy damage taken to it, obviously used by the HORI clan
members to brush up on their skills.  Racks of scrolls dwell in the corner of
the room along with bandages.  Hanging from the ceiling is a long rope, maybe
used for climbing.  Off to one side near the rope also sits a well-used
punching bag.  Opposite the punching bag is a well-worn stand for practicing
kicking on.
"
""
