"You are in a wide round pool with a narrow ledge of marble tiles lining its
rim.  The base of the pool is lined with a tile mozaic of a crimson sun just
cresting the horizon.  A set of submerged steps leads up and out through an
archway to the left providing egress back into the main stronghold.  On one of
the walls easily visisble upon coming in is a sign declaring \"No Running!\"
"
